 r of the Azad Hind Fauj (INA).\n\nFREE - regional/restricted holiday\, not
  a nationwide day off.\nRegion: West Bengal (state holiday)\; Parakram Diw
 as nationwide.\nDate is the same every year.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
